  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the App Interface**\n\nI\'m now focusing on the app\'s visual design. I\'ve decided on a gray and lavender color palette. The left side will feature horoscope data and other relevant details. Finally, the background will be a deep, celestial, astronomical image of the universe, dotted with stars.\n\n\n**Visualizing the Book Interface**\n\nI am now visualizing the book interaction and UI. The right panel will showcase a levitating and revolving book, using `framer-motion` for smooth animations. The books are categorized, and clicking a category will display a list, with selection causing the book to appear. I\'m aiming for a subtle, natural, and aesthetically pleasing design, while making the background a celestial video or image. The UI structure will be similar to the prompt.\n\n\n**Refining the Layout**\n\nI\'m now refining the layout based on the prompt. It\'s a two-panel split, using flex row with `min-h-screen`. The left panel is set to 52% width, the right at 48%, with the latter hidden on smaller screens. I am focusing on making the left panel the main content: navigation, horoscope, and celestial information.\n\n\n**Defining the Elements**\n\nI\'m now defining the UI elements. The right panel will showcase a levitating book, animated via `framer-motion`, while the background will be a deep space CSS background with animated stars. Color choices include various grays and lavenders like `#E6E6FA` and `#D3D3D3`. For the book, I\'ll attempt a `framer-motion` implementation with a 3D effect. The goal is a rotating, book-like CSS object with opening functionality.\n\n\n**Implementing Reading Functionality**\n\nI\'m now prioritizing the book reading function. I\'m focusing on the interaction; users can select, and actually *read*, content, not just view buttons. I\'ll mock up the contents of a few books for immediate functionality. I\'m also now considering the background, and will explore a pure CSS celestial background (twinkling stars and radial gradients) instead of using the tool, for performance. I\'m choosing a color palette with a dark background, accented with lavender tones. The UI layout for each panel is similar to before, with the notable addition of a \'Read\' button on the right for opening books.\n\n\n**Animating the Book**\n\nI\'m now implementing the book animation. I\'ll use `framer-motion` for a smooth, infinite rotation on the Y-axis and a subtle up-and-down movement on the Y-axis for depth. I\'m adapting the Liquid Glass CSS from the prompt, altering the color palette for a lavender and gray aesthetic. The plan is to create a dynamic, visually appealing book interaction.\n\n\n**Setting up the Files**\n\nI\'m now setting up the necessary files and dependencies. I\'ve confirmed the state of the `src/App.tsx` file and initiated the installation of `lucide-react` and `tailwind-merge` to assist in the implementation. I\'ll stick to a simple `cn` function or just template for the time being. I\'m also confirming the prompt, specifically regarding the levitating book interaction.\n\n\n**Organizing the Project**\n\nI\'m now structuring the project files. I\'m focusing on creating essential files: `src/lib/utils.ts`, `src/data.ts` for books and content, and components for `CelestialBackground.tsx` and `Book3D.tsx`. I\'ll also add Google Fonts (\"Poppins\" and \"Source Serif 4\") in `index.css`. I just checked the existing dependencies and made sure I have `lucide-react` installed. I will write the `Book3D.tsx` component next: a 3D rotating book.\n\n\n**Implementing the Book Animation**\n\nI\'m now integrating the book animation component, including a responsive implementation. I\'m focusing on the animation aspect and making it interactive. I\'ve successfully implemented the `framer-motion` implementation and it is animated, rotating, with an up-and-down motion. The book itself is responsive with added CSS, and is customizable with a new gradient. I am satisfied with the current implementation.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 23
      nanos: 812385432
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
