  planner_response {
    modified_response: "I have fully implemented the new updates for the immersive viewing experience, focusing on seamlessly blending the atmospheric Landing Page aesthetic directly into the Main Library.\n\n- **Cinematic Hero Identity**: Replaced the original generic video with a detailed, cinematic visual representing the user reading on the precipice of a cliff under a deep cosmic sky.\n- **Unified Atmospheric Design**: Extracted the rich `#101010` dark aesthetic and `#DEDBC8` celestial highlights from the landing view, applying it across the entire **Cliff Gallery** to establish a cohesive, premium visual continuity. \n- **Bifurcated Navigation**: The hero panel now provides two primary portals: \n  - **Deep Insights**: Bridges into the personal cosmic horoscope layouts.\n  - **The Cliff Gallery**: Guides directly into the curated library.\n- **Ambient Soundscapes**: Added a togglable immersive atmospheric deep-space acoustic track embedded throughout the Library to amplify the quiet, contemplative mood.\n- **Reading Progress Dashboard**: Reworked the `ReaderOverlay` into a robust dual-panel interface. It now displays an estimated time remaining, chapter tracking, a continuous learning streak counter, and an interactive \"cute\" bookmark toggle.\n- **Interactive Library States**: Simulated dynamic gallery saving with bookmark badges, extended the available catalog of philosophical and esoteric volumes, and rendered concise book summaries underneath the 3D-selected stage for immediate browsing context."
