  user_input {
    user_response: "https://dribbble.com/shots/26391625-Reader-App-Book-Slider\n\ni want you to redo the entire ui from scratch. go through the link i am pasting here and give me a similar layout for the sideways book scroll feature and landing page. keep the zodiac update for the day for the user on the top left side ot the screen with the temp and sun update. keep it minimal, readable and clean. \nreplicate the rating and reviews button and base it off of reddit and x social media reviews of the book.\n\nhttps://dribbble.com/shots/26968908-MidnightReads-Dark-Mode-Reading-App-UI-Design\nmake the landing page same as the link pasted above and as we scroll down we get the book selection area and other features that i mentioned above.\nthe main landing page would keep track of our reading progress and would have the quote/wxtract from any book or any other famous quote.\nmake the background more relaxing and calm visual based.\ndo not keep real faces anywhere and replace them with animated. playfu, cartoon style animation that goes with the whole theme.\nremove all unnecewsary buttons and features like insights, our tory, programs, astral insights, deep immersion and inquiries"
    items {
      text: "https://dribbble.com/shots/26391625-Reader-App-Book-Slider\n\ni want you to redo the entire ui from scratch. go through the link i am pasting here and give me a similar layout for the sideways book scroll feature and landing page. keep the zodiac update for the day for the user on the top left side ot the screen with the temp and sun update. keep it minimal, readable and clean. \nreplicate the rating and reviews button and base it off of reddit and x social media reviews of the book.\n\nhttps://dribbble.com/shots/26968908-MidnightReads-Dark-Mode-Reading-App-UI-Design\nmake the landing page same as the link pasted above and as we scroll down we get the book selection area and other features that i mentioned above.\nthe main landing page would keep track of our reading progress and would have the quote/wxtract from any book or any other famous quote.\nmake the background more relaxing and calm visual based.\ndo not keep real faces anywhere and replace them with animated. playfu, cartoon style animation that goes with the whole theme.\nremove all unnecewsary buttons and features like insights, our tory, programs, astral insights, deep immersion and inquiries"
    }
  }
