  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Reimagining the UI**\n\nI\'m currently focused on a complete UI redesign, drawing inspiration from two Dribbble shots. The \"Reader App Book Slider\" is inspiring the book presentation, and the \"Landing page\" is serving as a guide for the overall structure. The core focus will be to take these design concepts and apply them to the current feature sets. I\'m excited by this direction.\n\n\n**Refining the Layout**\n\nI\'ve been refining the layout, incorporating the \"MidnightReads\" shot for dark mode and the progress dashboard. I\'m focusing on a clean, minimal interface, aiming for a relaxing visual experience. The horizontal book slider and ratings/reviews, inspired by \"Reader-App-Book-Slider,\" are essential. I\'m prioritizing user-friendly reading progress tracking and a playful, animated style, steering clear of real faces and complex features. I\'m working to remove distracting elements, focusing on core reading functionality.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 4
      nanos: 475557429
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
